\msg_new:nnn { nulabreport } { overlay-palette-short }
  { An ~ overlay ~ has ~ more ~ traces ~ than ~ `overlay ~ colors' ~ entries; ~
    the ~ colours ~ repeat. ~ Give ~ a ~ longer ~ list, ~ e.g. ~
    overlay ~ colors={black,nuirred,nugold}, ~ or ~ `trace ~ color=' ~ per ~ panel. }
